# Bhauthika has no server-side secrets in Phase 1: the app is fully static and
# progress lives in the browser's localStorage.
#
# Phase 2 (Supabase auth + synced progress) will add the public client keys
# below. Public Next.js variables are inlined at build time, so never put a
# service-role key or any other secret in a NEXT_PUBLIC_* variable.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
